WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 7

01:40.480 --> 01:42.040
Master Du, you are quite reckless.

01:42.120 --> 01:44.400
Master Liu is by no means
an ordinary wealthy merchant.

01:44.480 --> 01:46.480
His businesses spread throughout
the capital of Song

01:46.560 --> 01:48.120
and every state and county.

01:48.200 --> 01:51.640
Even the esteemed nobility in the capital
have often received his financial support,

01:52.480 --> 01:55.240
though they deal with him in private.
You have deeply offended him today.

01:55.320 --> 01:57.400
He might very well
cripple your hand tomorrow.

01:57.480 --> 01:58.640
How will you take the exams?

01:59.880 --> 02:01.080
I know.

02:01.160 --> 02:02.360
You know?

02:02.440 --> 02:04.560
Knowing this, you still dared
to mock him in public?

02:06.600 --> 02:08.520
Master Chai, you know what I mean.

02:08.600 --> 02:11.000
If I didn't inscribe those words
on his mansion's gate

02:11.080 --> 02:14.160
and let all of Bianjing know he was mad
due to his failure in grabbing a groom,

02:14.240 --> 02:15.360
back then,

02:15.440 --> 02:18.480
you would not have been able to rescue me,
but to collect my corpse instead.

02:20.520 --> 02:23.560
A mere trifle of fleshly pain
is something I can endure.

02:23.640 --> 02:24.600
You are right.

02:25.280 --> 02:27.640
However, Master Du,

02:28.280 --> 02:29.800
Master Liu's daughter

02:29.880 --> 02:32.000
is of fine character and looks,
though not comparable

02:32.080 --> 02:33.720
to the goddess of the moon,

02:33.800 --> 02:35.880
and comes with the substantial dowry
of the Liu family.

02:35.960 --> 02:37.880
Why not go with it
and make it a happy occasion?

02:39.200 --> 02:41.600
Could it be that you already
have a wife at home?

02:42.240 --> 02:43.560
No.

02:43.640 --> 02:45.280
I have not yet taken a wife.

02:45.360 --> 02:47.240
Nor do I have a marriage engagement.

02:47.320 --> 02:49.640
But in Bianjing, when taking a wife
or marrying off a daughter,

02:49.720 --> 02:51.520
people don't care first about
moral characters,

02:51.600 --> 02:53.560
but for dowries and betrothal gifts.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.760
This is absolutely dishonorable.

02:56.440 --> 02:58.800
Won't that make all the Jinshi and Juren

02:58.880 --> 03:01.040
to be beggars and parasites?

03:01.760 --> 03:03.080
I deeply despise such practices.

03:04.080 --> 03:05.560
As for you, Master Chai,

03:05.640 --> 03:08.320
since you have a good relationship
with the Liu family,

03:08.400 --> 03:09.560
why not marry their daughter?

03:10.520 --> 03:13.200
In books, there are houses of gold
and ladies fair as jade.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.920
Is this not what you scholars pursue?

03:17.400 --> 03:19.320
If all the scholars in the world

03:19.400 --> 03:21.000
study for such purpose,

03:21.080 --> 03:22.960
wouldn't all the talents
selected by the state

03:23.040 --> 03:26.280
become those who go after fame and profit
and see beauty over righteousness?

03:27.520 --> 03:28.600
We are not the same kind.

03:28.680 --> 03:29.640
We shall part ways here.

03:29.720 --> 03:30.840
Master Du, wait.

03:30.920 --> 03:32.200
It was merely a test for you.

03:33.200 --> 03:34.720
When I make friends with someone,

03:34.800 --> 03:36.160
I don't see backgrounds or talents

03:36.240 --> 03:37.600
but their characters and ambition.

03:37.680 --> 03:40.360
Master Du, I believe we can hit it off.

03:41.280 --> 03:43.120
I spoke frankly. Please take no offense.

03:44.000 --> 03:47.080
If you don't mind my humble house,
why not move in and stay for a while?

03:47.680 --> 03:51.600
You can prepare for the exams without
trivial matters of money distract you.

03:52.200 --> 03:53.760
I am lodging at Xingguo Temple,

03:53.840 --> 03:55.000
not just because of money.

03:55.600 --> 03:57.720
There are many poor students living there.

03:57.800 --> 03:59.720
It's convenient for us
to discuss literature

03:59.800 --> 04:01.040
and exchange learnings there.

04:02.200 --> 04:04.160
- I won't bother you further.
- Master Du.

04:04.240 --> 04:06.480
This is not mere politeness.

04:07.600 --> 04:09.560
I am afraid
that staying at this wealthy place

04:10.160 --> 04:11.320
will reduce my resolve

04:11.400 --> 04:12.240
to study hard.

04:14.120 --> 04:15.360
Thank you for your kindness.

04:15.440 --> 04:17.800
- I'll take my leave.
- Master Du.

04:17.880 --> 04:19.600
Young Master,
this person is very stubborn.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.960
He won't let the physician treat him
and insists on leaving.

04:24.840 --> 04:26.440
Alright, I'll see you out.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.720
Andao.

04:32.880 --> 04:35.280
PAN RESTAURANT

04:35.360 --> 04:36.440
Master Du,

04:36.520 --> 04:38.920
if Master Liu causes trouble
for you again in the future

04:39.000 --> 04:41.720
or if you have any needs,
you can find me at Pan Restaurant.

04:43.560 --> 04:44.480
Thank you, Master Chai.

04:51.880 --> 04:52.720
Take care.

04:53.680 --> 04:55.320
I finally met a saint today

04:55.400 --> 04:57.440
who regards money as nothing but dirt.

04:57.960 --> 04:59.200
You believe in his nonsense?

04:59.280 --> 05:02.240
He mentioned the old acquaintance,
only to wait for me to rescue him.

05:02.320 --> 05:03.840
The country's official enrollment

05:03.920 --> 05:06.000
starts from being a Jinshi at your exams.

05:06.080 --> 05:08.280
Do not look down upon him
for being humble and poor now.

05:08.360 --> 05:09.640
Once he does the best on the exam,

05:09.720 --> 05:11.480
he'll marry the daughter of
a high-ranking official.

05:12.160 --> 05:14.520
How will he care
for a mere merchant's daughter,

05:14.600 --> 05:17.320
unless he is indeed foolish and sticks
to his learnings and readings?

05:17.400 --> 05:19.840
A person who does not seek petty gains
must have a steadfast heart.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.120
We must not underestimate them.

05:21.840 --> 05:23.400
The reticent one by his side

05:24.080 --> 05:25.480
doesn't seem to be ordinary either.

05:26.080 --> 05:28.920
Give the order. If he visits again,
report to me immediately.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.040
Yes.

05:34.120 --> 05:36.080
- Come in.
- Please come inside.

05:36.160 --> 05:37.560
- Please come inside.
- Young master,

05:37.640 --> 05:40.240
Sifu House has recently set up
a literature contest.

05:40.320 --> 05:42.280
They choose a topic
and everyone composes a poem.

05:42.360 --> 05:44.720
The best writer
will get the fee waived for the tea.

05:44.800 --> 05:45.960
and given additional gifts.

05:47.200 --> 05:48.880
She is not choosing the best writer.

05:48.960 --> 05:50.360
She's clearly choosing a son-in-law.

05:50.440 --> 05:52.480
But their method

05:52.560 --> 05:53.880
won't last more than two days.

05:58.040 --> 05:59.080
Yuanming.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.320
Since you had no intention of marrying,

06:01.400 --> 06:03.600
you should have concealed your talents
before Liu Tang.

06:03.680 --> 06:05.360
Why did you show off your talents
on purpose?

06:05.440 --> 06:07.680
In this capital, eminent scholars

06:07.760 --> 06:09.240
emerge in great numbers.

06:09.320 --> 06:10.960
If I hadn't, how'd my reputation be known?

06:11.040 --> 06:14.320
Content with poverty, devout to the path,
upholding propriety and righteousness.

06:14.400 --> 06:15.600
How will they know?

06:15.680 --> 06:16.920
Take care.

06:20.080 --> 06:21.160
Come take a look.

06:22.440 --> 06:23.960
Lady, have a look.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.320
CAKES

06:25.400 --> 06:26.320
It smells good.

06:26.400 --> 06:28.240
Sir, are you buying some cakes?

06:28.320 --> 06:30.200
They are all freshly baked and still warm.

06:30.280 --> 06:31.120
Look here.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.120
- I'll have one.
- Okay.

06:33.760 --> 06:34.920
Here is the money.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.360
- Here you go.
- Okay.

06:49.560 --> 06:50.600
Andao,

06:52.280 --> 06:53.880
I know you hate

06:53.960 --> 06:55.360
those who seek fame.

06:55.440 --> 06:56.680
But I must tell you.

06:56.760 --> 06:58.480
To be a good official,

06:58.560 --> 07:01.640
aside from caring
for the country and the people

07:01.720 --> 07:03.400
and being diligent and incorruptible,

07:03.480 --> 07:06.640
you also need
to be flexible and quick-witted.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.280
You must not stick to the rules rigidly.

07:09.120 --> 07:10.160
Also,

07:10.240 --> 07:11.200
how is your injury?

07:11.280 --> 07:12.440
You couldn't fight,

07:12.520 --> 07:13.440
and you didn't dodge.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.960
You are truly an honest one.

07:16.600 --> 07:17.920
Mind your own business first.

07:19.440 --> 07:20.600
Wait.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.520
Andao.

07:27.600 --> 07:29.440
Are you here for the literary matchmaking?

07:29.520 --> 07:30.760
- Please come inside.
- What's this?

07:30.840 --> 07:31.840
Right here.

07:31.920 --> 07:33.520
The literary matchmaking event is on.

07:33.600 --> 07:35.080
Please come in.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.040
Please.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.400
SIFU HOUSE

07:37.480 --> 07:38.720
A cup of Qibao pounded tea

07:38.800 --> 07:40.400
and a plate of Sanzi are coming.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.200
- Okay, thank you.
- Enjoy your meal.

07:44.640 --> 07:46.920
Li, you used this "gaze" word well.

07:48.680 --> 07:50.080
Zhang and Wang,

07:50.160 --> 07:51.480
look at this article.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.920
It's really good, isn't it?

07:56.000 --> 07:59.280
- Another bowl of salted soybean soup.
- Alright. Right away.

07:59.360 --> 08:01.720
- That's absolutely amazing.
- The brilliance is in this very stroke.

08:01.800 --> 08:02.880
Look at this.

08:02.960 --> 08:04.600
This is written so well.

08:04.680 --> 08:05.840
What a superb verse!

08:05.920 --> 08:06.800
And this one.

08:06.880 --> 08:07.920
It's really well-written.

08:08.680 --> 08:09.880
Young master,

08:09.960 --> 08:11.080
could you take a look?

08:11.160 --> 08:12.280
What does this sentence mean?

08:13.280 --> 08:14.520
You've read this sentence wrong.

08:14.600 --> 08:16.200
This is an acrostic poem.

08:16.280 --> 08:17.720
We need to read it horizontally,

08:17.800 --> 08:19.240
starting from this side.

08:19.320 --> 08:21.520
I see.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.520
Thank you, young master.

08:22.600 --> 08:24.440
To describe wind…

08:27.960 --> 08:30.000
How about using this character?

08:33.760 --> 08:36.440
Well written indeed!

08:36.520 --> 08:38.880
This brushwork is bold and powerful.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.520
Everyone, Pan Restaurant
is organizing a poetry contest.

08:41.600 --> 08:43.760
Great scholars
from the Imperial College will be judges.

08:43.840 --> 08:45.600
It's published
a list of top scholar candidates.

08:45.680 --> 08:47.600
The list of top scholar candidates?

08:47.680 --> 08:51.360
Don't go! You guys?

08:51.440 --> 08:52.800
Wait. Don't leave.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.880
They've all left…

08:58.160 --> 08:59.600
You haven't paid yet.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.560
Is there really not one

09:13.640 --> 09:15.040
that catches the eye?

09:15.120 --> 09:16.840
They all look good to me.

09:18.480 --> 09:21.320
A faint fragrance drifts,
seeming there and yet not.

09:22.160 --> 09:24.440
It's the incense most suitable
for literati and scholars.

09:25.480 --> 09:27.920
Big sis, the incense you've blended
can sell for a high price.

09:29.080 --> 09:31.240
We're worried about you
yet you talk about other things.

09:33.280 --> 09:35.960
If Shouhua says they're not good,
it must be the truth.

09:37.720 --> 09:38.680
I'd rather skip.

09:38.760 --> 09:40.800
But it has already been three days.

09:40.880 --> 09:42.600
The tea house is full every day.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.480
Not one qualified?

09:44.560 --> 09:46.400
There are quite a few poems here

09:46.480 --> 09:48.280
that you haven't read yet, sis.

09:48.360 --> 09:51.720
Today, I looked with Kangning
through the curtain.

09:51.800 --> 09:52.720
None are good-looking.

09:53.600 --> 09:54.520
Good-looking?

09:55.280 --> 09:57.480
Do you care for poetic talent

09:57.560 --> 09:58.720
or appearance?

09:59.400 --> 10:01.320
Poetic talent is indeed important,

10:01.400 --> 10:02.600
but appearance matters more.

10:02.680 --> 10:04.600
The imperial examinations

10:04.680 --> 10:06.120
select scholars with talent.

10:06.200 --> 10:07.720
How can you judge them by appearances?

10:07.800 --> 10:09.880
There'll be provincial examinations
next year,

10:09.960 --> 10:11.680
and the palace examination in March.

10:12.280 --> 10:14.160
The top ten papers
in the palace examination

10:14.240 --> 10:16.320
will all be ranked before His Majesty.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.480
According to tradition,

10:18.560 --> 10:21.240
His Majesty will personally meet
with the top three

10:21.320 --> 10:23.320
to determine the final rankings.

10:24.200 --> 10:27.480
Other than the written works,
what else does His Majesty consider?

10:28.720 --> 10:31.680
- Composure?
- These are unwritten conventions.

10:31.760 --> 10:32.920
Not to mention the top three.

10:33.640 --> 10:36.200
Aren't the most acclaimed scholars
this year

10:36.280 --> 10:39.040
all Juren who are dignified in appearance
and extraordinarily elegant?

10:40.680 --> 10:43.720
Besides, we're choosing
a husband for Kangning.

10:43.800 --> 10:45.080
An ugly man

10:45.880 --> 10:46.800
is unacceptable.

10:47.560 --> 10:49.080
Shouhua.

10:51.280 --> 10:52.600
I'm furious.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.320
Who upset you again?

10:59.400 --> 11:00.800
Of course, Pan Restaurant.

11:01.600 --> 11:03.680
They've started some kind
of top-scholar gambling pool.

11:03.760 --> 11:04.880
They've also invited

11:04.960 --> 11:08.240
some pedantic scholars to judge the poems.
They've drawn everyone over there.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.680
Stop that.

11:09.760 --> 11:12.240
I think they are deliberately
causing us trouble.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.640
Choosing a husband is a minor issue.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.800
Business is the priority.

11:16.640 --> 11:18.120
I wanted to take this good opportunity

11:18.200 --> 11:19.800
to gain some reputation for Sifu House.

11:20.440 --> 11:23.160
Now, it seems we must find another way.

11:57.600 --> 11:58.520
Kangning.

11:59.960 --> 12:00.800
Come in.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.200
Shouhua.

12:05.440 --> 12:07.720
You're still awake at this late hour?

12:08.800 --> 12:11.320
I remembered Father used to teach me
to paint plum blossoms.

12:11.400 --> 12:13.360
So, I felt inspired
and picked up the brush again.

12:13.440 --> 12:14.440
What do you need me for?

12:16.280 --> 12:17.560
I have something

12:18.680 --> 12:20.000
to add to your dowry.

12:23.680 --> 12:25.960
- Shao, quickly.
- Li.

12:26.040 --> 12:27.320
Sorry for being late.

12:27.400 --> 12:30.120
When did the literary matchmaking start?

12:30.200 --> 12:32.040
Li.

12:32.120 --> 12:34.000
- Pleased to meet you.
- Let's go.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.760
Let's go have a look.

12:35.840 --> 12:37.520
SIFU HOUSE

12:37.600 --> 12:38.680
What happened?

12:38.760 --> 12:39.680
Young master,

12:39.760 --> 12:43.520
Sifu House has put on a big display,
a literary contest to find a son-in-law.

12:43.600 --> 12:45.040
It's caused a sensation in the city.

12:45.120 --> 12:47.160
Everyone is rushing there
to watch the event.

12:48.600 --> 12:49.480
Zhao.

12:51.200 --> 12:54.320
Madam Li, even when a prominent family
holds a matchmaking session,

12:54.400 --> 12:56.280
they must present their daughter

12:56.360 --> 12:57.680
for the candidates to have a look.

12:57.760 --> 12:58.960
Yes. Exactly.

12:59.040 --> 13:01.760
You promised the literary matchmaking
personally,

13:01.840 --> 13:04.240
but you're hiding your daughter away.

13:04.320 --> 13:06.520
Could it be
that she is not outstanding at all,

13:06.600 --> 13:08.240
so that you plan this on purpose?

13:08.320 --> 13:10.200
- Right.
- Exactly.

13:10.280 --> 13:11.520
He is right.

13:11.600 --> 13:12.920
Please pardon my audacity.

13:13.000 --> 13:15.480
A daughter is born to resemble her mother.

13:15.560 --> 13:18.960
If your daughter resembles you a lot…

13:20.680 --> 13:21.520
Alright.

13:21.600 --> 13:23.320
I think all of us should head over

13:23.400 --> 13:25.680
to Pan Restaurant across the street
to evaluate poetry.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.680
- Right?
- That's right.

13:28.760 --> 13:30.400
Madam Li, did you summon us

13:30.480 --> 13:31.880
all here just to idly grind ink?

13:31.960 --> 13:33.560
Exactly.

13:33.640 --> 13:35.240
How tasteless you are!

13:36.040 --> 13:38.280
Who hasn't gone through
their youthful days?

13:38.880 --> 13:40.440
Back in my youth,

13:40.520 --> 13:42.320
those who came to propose marriage

13:42.400 --> 13:44.120
wore out eight door thresholds
of my house.

13:45.640 --> 13:47.120
All of you, on the other hand,

13:47.200 --> 13:49.320
don't provoke me any further.

13:49.920 --> 13:51.920
This is a literary matchmaking.

13:52.000 --> 13:53.680
Rules must be obeyed.

13:54.480 --> 13:55.440
What kind of rules?

13:55.520 --> 13:57.080
Come out.

14:02.480 --> 14:03.840
There's also a prize?

14:04.520 --> 14:05.800
What is this?

14:05.880 --> 14:07.520
It's okay if your daughter is a bit ugly.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.440
Be generous.

14:08.520 --> 14:10.520
These two can be the maids
accompanying the bride.

14:10.600 --> 14:13.400
It's an insult to scholarly grace.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.560
Lu, please don't be annoyed.

14:14.640 --> 14:15.960
No one here

14:16.040 --> 14:18.240
really wants to marry
the daughter of a tea house owner.

14:18.320 --> 14:19.800
For what? Her ability to make tea?

14:19.880 --> 14:22.000
We're all just here for a bit of fun.

14:22.600 --> 14:23.800
- That's right.
- Right.

14:28.680 --> 14:30.640
Well…

14:30.720 --> 14:33.360
- Is this…?
- This is a pearl curtain.

14:33.440 --> 14:35.760
This is worth a fortune.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.440
This is indeed worth a fortune.

14:45.720 --> 14:46.920
I can't accept this.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.320
It's the keepsake your ex-husband
left for you. Take it back.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.680
This pearl curtain

14:51.760 --> 14:53.080
was left to me by my husband.

14:53.760 --> 14:54.920
He wholeheartedly hoped

14:55.000 --> 14:56.440
that I could live well in the future.

14:57.320 --> 14:59.760
But for me to live well,
the Li family must be doing well.

15:00.880 --> 15:03.160
This pearl curtain
is not for you in particular, Kangning.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.120
It is a gift to someone

15:05.200 --> 15:07.320
who can shield the Li family
from the wind and rain

15:07.400 --> 15:09.560
in the not-too-distant future.

15:12.000 --> 15:12.880
Kangning,

15:13.680 --> 15:15.080
you must remember

15:15.160 --> 15:16.560
all the words I say tonight.

15:17.920 --> 15:20.200
Tomorrow, you must open your eyes wide

15:20.280 --> 15:22.240
and choose carefully.

15:22.320 --> 15:24.080
We've made a big scene,

15:24.160 --> 15:26.360
not just for your marriage.

15:27.160 --> 15:29.880
Although my family
is not a large household,

15:29.960 --> 15:33.080
all my daughters
have all been carefully raised

15:33.160 --> 15:34.680
and treated like pearls.

15:35.320 --> 15:38.640
In the future, no matter
which family my third daughter

15:38.720 --> 15:40.480
marries into, this pearl curtain

15:40.560 --> 15:42.760
will accompany her to the new family.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.800
- This is worth it.
- Good indeed.

15:45.880 --> 15:48.280
But let it be said upfront.

15:48.880 --> 15:51.360
My daughter
is a hundred times more precious

15:51.440 --> 15:52.720
than this pearl curtain.

15:53.320 --> 15:55.800
This is just a prize of good luck.

15:56.400 --> 15:58.560
If someone wins her over,

15:58.640 --> 16:01.640
it would be a blessing
for his whole family

16:01.720 --> 16:04.560
and a fortune that's been prayed for
by nine generations of ancestors.

16:04.640 --> 16:08.080
Make way. Make way.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.240
Exactly how ugly

16:12.320 --> 16:14.160
is your daughter

16:14.240 --> 16:15.560
that you're willing to part

16:15.640 --> 16:17.120
with such a treasure, Madam Li?

16:19.160 --> 16:21.320
How ugly is she exactly?

16:32.040 --> 16:33.040
She is so beautiful.

16:34.480 --> 16:36.000
- Indeed.
- Right.

16:36.080 --> 16:38.200
- She could be considered stunning.
- She's so beautiful.

16:41.200 --> 16:43.160
She is really gorgeous.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.720
She is so charming.

16:48.280 --> 16:49.200
Look.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.560
We will have a poetry topic.

16:52.640 --> 16:53.560
Gentlemen,

16:53.640 --> 16:54.640
take a good look.

17:05.840 --> 17:07.960
- Flower. Gentlemen, please look.
- Flower?

17:08.040 --> 17:09.200
The poetry topic is "flower".

17:09.280 --> 17:10.800
Flower?

17:11.880 --> 17:12.760
Flower?

17:18.320 --> 17:20.520
Young master, you were first arrogant
and now respectful.

17:20.600 --> 17:22.840
Your attitude
has changed too quickly, hasn't it?

17:22.920 --> 17:25.560
- Exactly.
- It has changed too fast.

17:25.640 --> 17:26.560
Exactly.

17:27.960 --> 17:28.880
That's right.

17:29.520 --> 17:31.360
He is a man with two faces.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.240
Young lady, don't go.

17:49.320 --> 17:51.200
- Why are you leaving?
- Don't go.

17:51.280 --> 17:55.640
SIFU HOUSE

18:02.600 --> 18:04.760
- Young master.
- Go.

18:04.840 --> 18:06.440
Summon someone for me.

18:06.520 --> 18:08.720
- Who?
- Du Yangxi.

18:08.800 --> 18:11.840
Madam Li, is it true that whoever
wins the poetry contest

18:11.920 --> 18:13.400
can marry your daughter?

18:14.760 --> 18:16.320
Mother-in-law.

18:16.400 --> 18:18.520
- Piss off.
- A person's word is their bond.

18:18.600 --> 18:19.920
If I were to seriously

18:20.000 --> 18:21.240
start composing poetry,

18:21.320 --> 18:22.680
you must not go back on your word.

18:22.760 --> 18:25.720
Who is your mother-in-law?
My poetry skills are better than yours.

18:25.800 --> 18:27.560
In terms of talent,

18:27.640 --> 18:29.400
who can surpass me?

18:31.200 --> 18:32.360
Goose, goose, goose.

18:32.440 --> 18:35.000
Its neck bends as it sings to the sky.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.160
What is this for?

18:39.240 --> 18:40.640
This is…

18:41.240 --> 18:44.240
Inside this house, there is no boundary
between men and women.

18:44.320 --> 18:47.200
My daughter willing to show her face

18:47.280 --> 18:48.640
is already an exception.

18:50.440 --> 18:51.840
What I'm baking today

18:51.920 --> 18:53.600
is top-scholar's pastry.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.720
Top-scholar's pastry?

18:54.800 --> 18:57.000
This is good.

18:57.080 --> 18:58.920
Once the pastry is well baked,

18:59.000 --> 19:00.840
all your poems

19:00.920 --> 19:02.280
must be ready as well.

19:04.120 --> 19:05.040
I see.

19:05.120 --> 19:07.040
What are you waiting for?

19:07.120 --> 19:09.040
Hurry. Get writing.

19:12.160 --> 19:14.240
- Dear me!
- Get me two pieces of pastry.

19:14.320 --> 19:17.600
There are plenty out there
who wish to be my son-in-law.

19:17.680 --> 19:20.320
Make way for me quickly.

19:20.400 --> 19:21.440
Have a pot of tea.

19:22.480 --> 19:23.520
Flower.

19:31.960 --> 19:33.000
Alright.

19:33.080 --> 19:35.000
Only these two have the best poems.

19:37.480 --> 19:39.200
That plum-blossom poem is rather ordinary.

19:40.120 --> 19:41.000
But this one…

19:42.120 --> 19:45.800
Whether read from left or right,
it doesn't make a poem either way.

19:49.400 --> 19:52.720
Returning from flower viewing
The horse flies like the wind

19:53.400 --> 19:56.040
The horse flies like the wind
I was drunk with little wine

19:56.920 --> 20:00.320
With the wine, I awake at dusk

20:00.400 --> 20:03.280
It's dusk when I awake
Returning from the flower viewing

20:03.960 --> 20:05.720
This is a palindromic poem.

20:05.800 --> 20:07.280
It seems to have only one "flower",

20:08.320 --> 20:10.360
yet two lines
both conceal the word "flower".

20:10.440 --> 20:12.520
Clever indeed.

20:12.600 --> 20:14.000
But between the two of them,

20:14.080 --> 20:15.440
who truly is today's champion?

20:16.640 --> 20:17.760
Both are.

20:17.840 --> 20:18.680
And neither are.

20:19.400 --> 20:21.120
Poetry creation requires inspiration.

20:21.800 --> 20:23.760
When everyone sits in the tea house,

20:23.840 --> 20:25.680
writing for the poetry challenge,

20:25.760 --> 20:27.360
how could they write their best?

20:27.440 --> 20:29.920
Knowing they couldn't do well,
why would you set such a challenge?

20:30.560 --> 20:32.000
The poetry topic is ordinary.

20:32.080 --> 20:34.120
Who knows whether they've
taken someone else's poem

20:34.200 --> 20:35.600
to fool us?

20:36.760 --> 20:38.680
This excellent handwriting

20:38.760 --> 20:39.880
is very rare.

20:40.480 --> 20:41.720
I don't know much about writing.

20:41.800 --> 20:43.960
How does it compare
to your writing, Shouhua?

20:44.680 --> 20:46.040
It surpasses mine by far.

20:46.640 --> 20:48.360
The calligraphy takes

20:49.080 --> 20:51.120
at least ten years of diligent practice

20:51.200 --> 20:52.360
throughout seasons.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.480
It's no easy work.

20:54.160 --> 20:56.000
With such perseverance and talent,

20:56.080 --> 20:58.680
the person is well-educated
without asking.

20:59.560 --> 21:02.040
However, I still have to test him again.

21:03.720 --> 21:06.160
Limited to the baking time
in the inner room

21:06.240 --> 21:08.200
and surrounded by spectators
in the outer room,

21:08.920 --> 21:09.880
this round tested

21:09.960 --> 21:11.640
their quick wit and composure.

21:12.360 --> 21:14.360
Finding more about them is not difficult.

21:15.040 --> 21:17.040
Don't we have a second round?

21:17.120 --> 21:19.120
Kangning, go and try them,
and then you will know.

21:36.240 --> 21:38.760
It's hard to judge the superior
poetry of you two at the moment.

21:38.840 --> 21:40.680
I have a couplet here.

21:40.760 --> 21:42.080
May I ask you to attempt a match?

21:44.440 --> 21:45.960
Please go ahead, young lady.

21:46.040 --> 21:47.840
Here is the first line of the couplet.

21:47.920 --> 21:50.120
Li Boyang has "Li" as the surname,

21:50.200 --> 21:51.720
born with knowledge.

21:51.800 --> 21:53.120
Li Boyang?

21:53.200 --> 21:54.040
It refers

21:54.120 --> 21:56.400
to Laozi, who was born with knowledge
of all things.

21:56.480 --> 21:58.560
The difficulty of this first line
lies in the fact

21:58.640 --> 22:00.520
that the first sentence
has two "Li" characters.

22:01.160 --> 22:02.840
Not just that.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.320
The "birth" character below

22:04.400 --> 22:06.840
also aligns with the right arm
of the "surname" character above.

22:07.840 --> 22:09.360
This is a character-dissection game.

22:09.440 --> 22:11.840
Young lady, are you deliberately
making things difficult?

22:12.520 --> 22:14.160
Who can match this couplet on the spot?

22:14.240 --> 22:16.400
- Yes, indeed.
- It's too difficult.

22:18.080 --> 22:19.520
Then you better listen well.

22:19.600 --> 22:22.800
My match is "Ma Wenyuan had his body
wrapped in horsehide,

22:22.880 --> 22:24.360
dead without giving up."

22:25.680 --> 22:27.160
"Ma Yuan" corresponds to "Li Boyang".

22:27.240 --> 22:30.000
"Dead without giving up" corresponds
to "born with knowledge".

22:30.080 --> 22:31.920
Very good.

22:32.000 --> 22:34.360
- Good.
- And the "death" character

22:34.440 --> 22:36.320
corresponds to the "corpse" character.

22:36.400 --> 22:38.120
Incredibly clever.

22:38.200 --> 22:40.120
Clever.

22:40.200 --> 22:43.440
Splendid.

22:43.520 --> 22:45.120
Young master, may I have your name?

22:45.200 --> 22:47.400
How old are you, and where is your home?

22:48.440 --> 22:49.600
I have a daughter

22:49.680 --> 22:50.600
who is good

22:50.680 --> 22:52.320
in both appearance and character.

22:52.400 --> 22:54.720
I am willing to betroth her to you.

22:55.600 --> 22:57.640
Congratulations, young master.

22:57.720 --> 22:59.080
I'm afraid there's a grand success

22:59.160 --> 23:00.400
to come after the wedding.

23:00.480 --> 23:01.480
Congratulations.

23:01.560 --> 23:03.920
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

23:06.040 --> 23:07.880
I'm Jia Ming, from Hongzhou.

23:07.960 --> 23:09.720
Thank you for your kind suggestion, Madam.

23:11.200 --> 23:14.040
But are you sure you will betroth
your daughter to me?

23:14.120 --> 23:15.880
I set up this literary challenge
in public.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.240
Everyone here can be a witness.

23:17.320 --> 23:18.200
How can it be false?

23:20.280 --> 23:21.920
This cannot be rushed.

23:22.000 --> 23:24.400
I need to finish my exams
and return home first

23:24.480 --> 23:26.320
and then discuss it with my wife.

23:27.000 --> 23:28.040
Your wife?

23:28.120 --> 23:30.200
So, he has a wife.

23:30.280 --> 23:31.160
Madam Li,

23:31.240 --> 23:34.040
you wouldn't betroth your beautiful
daughter to him as a concubine, would you?

23:34.120 --> 23:35.560
All the fuss is for nothing.

23:35.640 --> 23:37.320
You might as well
marry your daughter to me.

23:37.400 --> 23:38.760
Wait.

23:38.840 --> 23:39.880
You…

23:39.960 --> 23:41.240
If you are already married,

23:41.320 --> 23:42.720
why didn't you say so earlier?

23:44.520 --> 23:45.720
Madam,

23:45.800 --> 23:47.480
I was just passing by

23:47.560 --> 23:49.280
and saw that it was very lively here.

23:49.360 --> 23:52.600
I thought there was a poetry contest
or literary contest going on

23:52.680 --> 23:54.080
to make friends through literature.

23:54.160 --> 23:56.840
Who would have thought your family
was so eager to find a son-in-law

23:56.920 --> 23:58.600
before the Ministry of Rites
started the exams?

23:58.680 --> 24:00.720
Are you fooling me?

24:00.800 --> 24:01.800
Huh?

24:02.440 --> 24:03.680
Mother, wait.

24:03.760 --> 24:06.160
My third daughter, he is making
a fool of us in public.

24:06.240 --> 24:08.280
Young master, since you
already have a wife at home,

24:08.360 --> 24:10.120
I naturally cannot marry you.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.480
There's no need to mention
the pearl curtain again.

24:13.120 --> 24:16.080
However, you are still the champion
of the day.

24:16.160 --> 24:17.800
So, you can take another prize.

24:17.880 --> 24:20.000
- There is another prize?
- What will it be?

24:20.080 --> 24:21.840
- Another prize?
- There is another prize.

24:21.920 --> 24:26.040
Besides the pearl curtain and you,
there is another prize?

24:27.360 --> 24:29.160
Bright eyes, long ears, big mouth,

24:29.240 --> 24:30.800
and the feet are even more nimble.

24:30.880 --> 24:33.920
Not even knowing what place this is,
and they just barged in straightforwardly.

24:34.000 --> 24:36.960
Today's prize actually matches you.

24:44.680 --> 24:47.160
She said I had sharp eyes,

24:47.240 --> 24:49.600
long ears, and a big mouth,

24:50.240 --> 24:52.760
and I just rushed there happily,
wherever there is excitement.

24:53.480 --> 24:56.240
At first, I was puzzled.

24:56.320 --> 25:00.040
But after thinking it over carefully,
she was talking about a donkey.

25:03.880 --> 25:06.320
Master Chai, you may not know.

25:06.400 --> 25:08.640
But now, the Li family's
literary matchmaking

25:08.720 --> 25:10.560
has become the latest joke
in all of Bianjing.

25:10.640 --> 25:12.680
Do you know what people call me
behind my back?

25:12.760 --> 25:13.920
Top-scholar Donkey.

25:14.480 --> 25:16.000
Luckily that day, I disguised myself.

25:16.080 --> 25:18.160
Otherwise, my reputation

25:18.240 --> 25:20.320
would have been completely ruined
by the Third Lady.

25:22.120 --> 25:22.960
What a pity.

25:23.760 --> 25:25.040
What?

25:25.800 --> 25:29.480
Li Boyang has "Li" as the surname,
born with knowledge.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.800
She is able to come up with this couplet.

25:31.880 --> 25:34.480
This young lady must have talent
that is not beneath mine.

25:35.480 --> 25:38.480
It's a pity that I arrived late
and didn't get to witness her beauty.

25:38.560 --> 25:41.760
But to make many scholars bow down,

25:41.840 --> 25:44.520
she must be a beauty with talent.

25:46.640 --> 25:47.520
I don't agree.

25:54.400 --> 25:55.600
Chai,

25:55.680 --> 25:58.200
what deep grudge do you actually have
against the Third Lady?

25:58.280 --> 26:00.240
Why did you intend to ruin her marriage?

26:00.320 --> 26:03.360
There's no grudge or resentment.
It's just we've crossed paths in business.

26:03.440 --> 26:06.720
The small Sifu House took away
the business of the entire street.

26:06.800 --> 26:08.320
Can't I pay back in a little?

26:08.400 --> 26:09.720
Then you are too harsh.

26:09.800 --> 26:11.640
You didn't see

26:11.720 --> 26:13.880
that Madam Li's face
almost turned green with anger.

26:13.960 --> 26:15.240
Angry enough to tear me in half.

26:16.000 --> 26:18.320
Do you really think
that Li Kangning would be at a loss?

26:20.440 --> 26:23.360
She has already made a fortune.

26:45.120 --> 26:47.120
It's like a dream.

26:48.880 --> 26:52.560
Hurry and put away
my precious pearl curtain.

26:53.240 --> 26:55.680
Next year, Haode can still use it.

26:56.880 --> 26:59.000
And the year after,
Leshan can still use it.

27:09.240 --> 27:12.680
These two households are originally one.
They are separated by only a wall.

27:12.760 --> 27:14.720
It was originally going
to be rented out to others.

27:14.800 --> 27:16.400
I've specially kept it for you.

27:16.480 --> 27:18.200
I told you this shop
would bring you luck, right?

27:18.280 --> 27:20.320
As I expected, it hasn't been long.

27:20.400 --> 27:22.840
Business is booming.

27:22.920 --> 27:25.480
You've renewed the lease of the shop
for another two years.

27:25.560 --> 27:27.520
Now you've rented this courtyard as well.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.640
Your future blessings

27:29.720 --> 27:31.200
will be endless and inexhaustible.

27:32.000 --> 27:33.160
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

27:33.240 --> 27:35.040
The wall between
the two households is too low.

27:35.120 --> 27:36.520
If you rent it to someone else,

27:36.600 --> 27:38.720
they'll take the opportunity
to spy on my backyard.

27:38.800 --> 27:39.640
Right?

27:39.720 --> 27:41.560
You are right.

27:41.640 --> 27:42.520
Then,

27:42.600 --> 27:43.960
I've handed over the keys to you.

27:44.040 --> 27:45.560
- Make sure to keep them safe.
- Alright.

27:45.640 --> 27:47.760
You must call her "good lady"
to get some porridge.

27:47.840 --> 27:50.000
Good lady.

27:50.080 --> 27:52.600
This girl is quite a beauty.

27:52.680 --> 27:53.920
- Enough.
- Madam.

27:54.000 --> 27:56.000
Alright. Now that I have the keys,

27:56.080 --> 27:57.200
let's cut the formalities.

27:57.280 --> 27:59.440
I will go to you if there is anything.
You can leave now.

27:59.520 --> 28:00.880
- Be sure to come to me.
- Take care.

28:00.960 --> 28:02.160
- Come to me.
- I won't see you off.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.440
Come to me.

28:03.520 --> 28:05.040
Here. Take this.

28:06.560 --> 28:08.640
These peddlers who roam the streets

28:08.720 --> 28:10.320
are really cunning and treacherous.

28:10.400 --> 28:12.880
They find loopholes
to sneak into peoples' private quarters.

28:12.960 --> 28:14.400
Your younger sisters are still young.

28:14.480 --> 28:15.880
In the future, when I'm not home,

28:15.960 --> 28:17.200
don't open the door for them.

28:17.280 --> 28:19.160
I know.

28:19.240 --> 28:21.480
Mother,
ever since the literary matchmaking,

28:21.560 --> 28:23.920
there are quite a few people
hanging outside our door all day.

28:24.000 --> 28:25.720
I've seen them several times
when I went out.

28:25.800 --> 28:27.200
- It's so terrifying.
- Absolutely.

28:27.280 --> 28:29.240
Our household is all women.

28:29.320 --> 28:31.240
It's inevitable we attract
the attention of scoundrels.

28:31.320 --> 28:33.440
Fortunately, we exchange frequent visits
with the Fan's.

28:33.520 --> 28:34.800
Otherwise, our life would be

28:34.880 --> 28:36.520
- far from peaceful.
- Here.

28:36.600 --> 28:39.800
I should marry you two off
sooner rather than later.

28:39.880 --> 28:41.480
That would settle one of my worries.

28:41.560 --> 28:43.000
Madam Li, rest assured.

28:43.080 --> 28:45.080
We're here to guard the gate for you.

28:46.800 --> 28:47.640
Thank you.

28:48.640 --> 28:51.960
This porridge is all ready.
Take it back and share it with them.

28:52.040 --> 28:54.280
Okay. Thank you, young lady.

28:54.360 --> 28:55.440
Go ahead. Don't spill it.

28:55.520 --> 28:57.520
Remember to return the bowl.

28:57.600 --> 28:58.480
Okay.

28:58.560 --> 28:59.520
I've got it.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.680
Where's Shouhua?

29:01.760 --> 29:04.280
Leshan has caught a chill.
Haode is taking care of her inside.

29:04.360 --> 29:06.320
Shouhua said she thought

29:06.400 --> 29:08.960
of her ex-husband's prescription.
She's gone to get the medicine.

29:10.240 --> 29:12.040
She's back.

29:19.960 --> 29:20.840
Shouhua.

29:20.920 --> 29:21.880
You…

29:22.480 --> 29:25.160
- What happened to you?
- He was frozen stiff on the way.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.560
I was passing by.

29:33.520 --> 29:35.880
He is frozen.

29:35.960 --> 29:37.040
Poor young man.

29:37.120 --> 29:38.800
- Can he make it through?
- Qiongnu, hurry up.

29:40.360 --> 29:41.760
- The water is here.
- He is frozen.

29:42.600 --> 29:44.160
He's freezing to death. Hurry.

29:44.240 --> 29:46.120
- Get him bowl of ginger soup.
- Okay.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.560
This poor thing.

29:56.040 --> 29:57.280
Wait.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.160
It's him.

29:59.240 --> 30:00.320
Don't save him. Stop.

30:00.400 --> 30:01.240
Don't lie down here.

30:01.320 --> 30:02.960
- Get off the bed.
- Mother, he's not up yet.

30:03.040 --> 30:05.080
- What are you doing?
- Wait. Kangning,

30:05.160 --> 30:06.040
don't you remember him?

30:07.040 --> 30:08.640
He's that man from the other day…

30:10.200 --> 30:12.200
He's the one from the day
of the literary matchmaking.

30:14.680 --> 30:16.320
It's him.

30:16.920 --> 30:18.680
- Right? You recognize him now.
- It's actually him.

30:19.280 --> 30:21.280
A heartless villain like him deserves
to freeze to death.

30:21.360 --> 30:22.640
Let's beat him to death.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.960
- We won't save you.
- Mother.

30:24.040 --> 30:24.920
- Stop.
- Mother.

30:25.000 --> 30:27.680
Don't. It'd be okay
if we let him freeze to death earlier,

30:27.760 --> 30:30.160
but if you throw him out now,
those who don't know the whole story

30:30.240 --> 30:32.880
might actually condemn us as heartless
and impious.

30:32.960 --> 30:35.720
Mother, I'm the one being teased.
I'm not even holding a grudge.

30:35.800 --> 30:37.760
Isn't saving a life
better than offering food

30:37.840 --> 30:40.240
- and donating money?
- Xing…

30:41.560 --> 30:43.160
Xingguo Temple…

30:44.240 --> 30:45.320
There is someone there.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.160
Who's there?

30:47.240 --> 30:49.520
There is someone there.

30:49.600 --> 30:52.160
He keeps mentioning Xingguo Temple.
Who could be there?

30:52.240 --> 30:55.720
Maybe he is a Juren
coming here from the imperial exams

30:55.800 --> 30:57.360
and he is worried about his luggage.

30:57.440 --> 30:58.720
In my opinion,

30:58.800 --> 31:00.960
we can send an errand boy
to Xingguo Temple

31:01.040 --> 31:02.120
to find out his details

31:02.200 --> 31:03.800
and take care of his belongings,

31:03.880 --> 31:06.280
especially the poems
and essays he writes regularly,

31:06.360 --> 31:08.720
- to make sure they're not lost.
- You're not allowed to go.

31:08.800 --> 31:10.760
You two are too kind.

31:10.840 --> 31:13.680
Since we know where he's from,
we should send him back to Xingguo Temple.

31:13.760 --> 31:15.240
I won't feed this wolf-hearted scoundrel.

31:15.320 --> 31:16.920
He's being forced
to stay at Xingguo Temple.

31:17.000 --> 31:18.640
Who's there to take care of him?

31:18.720 --> 31:21.240
If you send him off
and he dies on the way…

31:22.880 --> 31:24.360
Mother, he is a Juren after all.

31:25.440 --> 31:26.840
Juren, right?

31:27.560 --> 31:29.120
We have to save him.

31:30.000 --> 31:32.760
But we should still find out
if he's married.

31:32.840 --> 31:34.320
We won't save him if he's married.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.800
- We won't save him then.
- Okay.

31:40.520 --> 31:42.240
You deserve to freeze to death.

32:30.280 --> 32:31.200
What did you say?

32:31.280 --> 32:34.240
I was ordered to bring Mr. Du charcoal
and cotton-padded clothes for winter.

32:34.320 --> 32:35.760
But the temple keeper said
he moved away.

32:35.840 --> 32:37.000
Moved to where?

32:37.080 --> 32:39.160
It's said that Mr. Du's close friend
had a fever.

32:39.240 --> 32:41.440
He ran around seeking medicine for him.

32:41.520 --> 32:44.120
Unfortunately, he fell ill by the roadside
and saved by the Li family.

32:44.720 --> 32:46.160
The Li family also took his luggage away

32:46.240 --> 32:47.720
along with his sick friend.

32:47.800 --> 32:50.400
Well,
why is it the Li family of all people?

32:54.520 --> 32:57.120
I have already checked.
Leshan has taken the medicine and sweat.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.600
She is now sleeping soundly.

32:59.560 --> 33:01.080
Keep the medicine dregs

33:01.160 --> 33:02.440
and send them to that man

33:02.520 --> 33:03.840
so as to avoid seeking physicians.

33:03.920 --> 33:06.560
Otherwise, given Mother's frugality,
she wants to drive those two away.

33:06.640 --> 33:07.760
I see.

33:07.840 --> 33:09.320
Chunlai, you may continue.

33:10.480 --> 33:11.480
Those two people

33:11.560 --> 33:12.480
were cramped in a room

33:12.560 --> 33:14.360
as small as a chicken coop.

33:14.440 --> 33:16.160
Other than a worn ink stone,

33:16.240 --> 33:17.280
a few broken brushes,

33:17.360 --> 33:18.800
and several volumes of old books,

33:18.880 --> 33:21.560
what's left was an oil lamp
that you wouldn't get a drop of oil out of

33:21.640 --> 33:23.000
even if you rub it for three days.

33:23.080 --> 33:25.960
The temple keeper says
if there is a day when they

33:26.040 --> 33:27.200
don't set up to sell writings,

33:27.280 --> 33:29.160
they probably won't even
fill their stomachs.

33:29.760 --> 33:32.200
In this world,
there are actually such poor Jurens.

33:32.280 --> 33:33.440
It's really quite astonishing.

33:34.240 --> 33:36.160
Then he was lying

33:36.240 --> 33:37.440
when he said he had a wife.

33:38.120 --> 33:40.160
Being so poor,
how could he support a wife?

33:40.920 --> 33:44.080
To raise money for traveling
to the capital for the exams,

33:44.160 --> 33:46.200
it's common for people
to sell land and borrow money.

33:46.880 --> 33:49.040
Moreover, I find
in their collection of books

33:49.120 --> 33:51.840
quite a few rare hand-copied editions,
seldom seen on the streets.

33:52.440 --> 33:53.400
It appears

33:53.480 --> 33:55.680
that whenever these two people
have a bit of money,

33:55.760 --> 33:57.760
they spend it at the book market
of Xiangguo Temple.

33:58.400 --> 34:00.800
Shouhua, are you saying
that they are a master and his servant?

34:00.880 --> 34:02.040
No.

34:02.120 --> 34:05.040
The temple keeper says
these two are quite strange.

34:05.120 --> 34:07.200
They frequently exchange their clothes.

34:07.280 --> 34:09.600
And they take turns
attending their writing stall.

34:15.680 --> 34:16.960
I see.

34:17.040 --> 34:19.360
Although they're poor Jurens
coming to the capital for the exams,

34:19.440 --> 34:20.920
they inevitably need to visit friends.

34:21.000 --> 34:24.000
Without a servant by their side,
they couldn't enter people's gatehouses.

34:24.640 --> 34:27.480
Pretending to be each other's servant
is a good way for them to save face.

34:28.200 --> 34:29.920
Shouhua, your finding was quite something.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.400
You've actually found two Jurens.

34:33.880 --> 34:36.440
These two pedantic scholars
are really interesting.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.680
Very peculiar indeed.

34:42.320 --> 34:44.000
- Two scholars.
- Mother.

34:44.080 --> 34:46.200
- Leshan is much better now.
- Two.

34:47.160 --> 34:48.520
Mother?

34:48.600 --> 34:50.000
Two scholars.

34:50.080 --> 34:52.400
Has Mother heard it?

34:52.480 --> 34:54.000
Heard what exactly?

34:54.080 --> 34:55.680
She looks so happy.

35:04.240 --> 35:05.600
Yuanming,

35:05.680 --> 35:08.680
if Cousin Fan hadn't mentioned it,
I wouldn't have known that you moved here.

35:08.760 --> 35:10.960
How can you live in such a humble place?

35:11.040 --> 35:12.280
Deqing.

35:12.360 --> 35:15.040
Hurry and pack Mr. Du's luggage.
Take him to my house to recuperate.

35:16.000 --> 35:16.960
- Master Chai…
- Yuanming,

35:17.040 --> 35:19.960
this time, you must listen to me.

35:20.040 --> 35:21.160
Do it.

35:24.320 --> 35:26.000
- Mother-in-law.
- Madam Li.

35:26.720 --> 35:27.840
What's wrong with my place?

35:27.920 --> 35:29.440
He can't live here?

35:30.280 --> 35:31.560
My entire family lives here,

35:31.640 --> 35:32.920
and we are just fine.

35:33.000 --> 35:34.680
Madam Li, you've misunderstood.

35:34.760 --> 35:35.920
I absolutely didn't mean that.

35:36.000 --> 35:37.480
Mother-in-law,

35:37.560 --> 35:39.240
my cousin didn't mean that.

35:39.320 --> 35:42.200
He means this courtyard
was originally used for storage.

35:42.280 --> 35:44.080
And it will be quite inconvenient
for Master Du

35:44.160 --> 35:46.840
- if he wants to study for the exam.
- What's inconvenient about it?

35:46.920 --> 35:49.000
He lived in Xingguo Temple's wing room.

35:49.080 --> 35:50.040
Now he can't live here?

35:50.120 --> 35:53.560
Is the roof missing a tile

35:53.640 --> 35:55.320
or the floor missing a brick?

35:55.400 --> 35:59.280
Or does the Chai's mansion
have one more wall than others?

35:59.360 --> 36:00.600
Madam Li,

36:01.560 --> 36:03.280
I sincerely meant well.

36:03.360 --> 36:04.960
The Li household is all women.

36:05.040 --> 36:08.280
It would be quite inconvenient
for young men to live here for long.

36:08.360 --> 36:10.760
The two courtyards
are separated by a wall,

36:10.840 --> 36:12.240
and they each have their own gate.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.960
They are simply unrelated.

36:14.720 --> 36:17.200
As for me, I had already planned

36:17.280 --> 36:18.960
to rent out the east and west wings

36:19.040 --> 36:21.280
and use the main room as a storeroom.

36:21.360 --> 36:24.120
But our household is all women.

36:24.200 --> 36:26.120
It's not proper to rent
to complicated tenants.

36:26.200 --> 36:29.200
As for you two,
you are both decent scholars.

36:29.280 --> 36:30.520
If you live at my place,

36:30.600 --> 36:33.520
you can study with peace of mind

36:33.600 --> 36:36.840
and help me guard my home.

36:36.920 --> 36:39.840
Sifu House
is frequented by many literary guests.

36:39.920 --> 36:42.360
So, there will be no shortage of repartee.

36:43.040 --> 36:44.480
I will reduce the rent

36:44.560 --> 36:46.480
and provide meals every day.

36:46.560 --> 36:48.880
And you can help with writing
on the counter.

36:48.960 --> 36:50.960
Isn't it convenient for both sides?

36:51.040 --> 36:53.080
But Madam Li, if Yuanming stays--

36:53.160 --> 36:54.480
But the physician also said

36:54.560 --> 36:56.360
the situation of your friend
in the other room

36:56.440 --> 36:57.520
is greatly undermined.

36:57.600 --> 36:59.720
He's like a tree with its roots damaged.

36:59.800 --> 37:02.320
If moved, that could mean death to him.

37:04.000 --> 37:05.400
Young Master Du,

37:05.480 --> 37:08.720
you have to decide for yourself.

37:09.680 --> 37:11.160
Yuanming, say something.

37:11.240 --> 37:15.280
Chai, well,
Madam Li is full of good intentions

37:16.080 --> 37:17.640
and considerate in every aspect.

37:17.720 --> 37:19.520
To decline her would actually be rude.

37:19.600 --> 37:22.000
So, I have no choice
but to accept her kindness

37:22.080 --> 37:23.600
and repay her in the future.

37:35.000 --> 37:36.840
You called me out early in the morning

37:36.920 --> 37:38.640
to accompany you
to see these two scholars.

37:38.720 --> 37:41.280
If you didn't come,
would the Li family let me in?

37:45.400 --> 37:47.920
Cousin, what in the world do you want?

38:10.120 --> 38:11.240
What are you doing?

38:11.800 --> 38:15.040
I want to know what's wrong with this wall
that it's worth staring at it for so long.

38:16.040 --> 38:17.280
This wall

38:18.840 --> 38:19.800
is too high.

38:21.320 --> 38:22.600
Too high?

38:30.680 --> 38:31.720
Mother.

38:32.480 --> 38:34.240
Shouhua. Kangning.

38:35.280 --> 38:36.160
Come quickly.

38:37.640 --> 38:40.520
- Come quickly.
- What's the rush?

38:44.280 --> 38:45.520
W-What are you doing?

38:45.600 --> 38:47.720
What's this for?

38:55.360 --> 38:56.400
You… This…

38:56.480 --> 38:57.800
You…

38:59.000 --> 39:00.400
Who are you people?

39:00.480 --> 39:03.760
How can you start redoing the wall
without talking to the owner?

39:03.840 --> 39:05.240
Who are they?

39:05.320 --> 39:06.400
Madam Li, do not be upset.

39:06.480 --> 39:09.160
My master has ordered us to clean up
and reorganize this place

39:09.240 --> 39:11.360
so that Master Du
can live more comfortably.

39:11.440 --> 39:12.720
I'll tell them to be gentler

39:12.800 --> 39:13.800
and not to disturb you.

39:13.880 --> 39:17.640
- Then, what's the deal with this wall?
- The household over the wall is all women.

39:17.720 --> 39:19.920
A gentleman prevents trouble
and avoids sketchy places.

39:20.560 --> 39:22.600
I've ordered them
to raise this low wall by a few feet

39:22.680 --> 39:23.920
to remove any ground for gossip.

39:24.560 --> 39:25.800
And Master Du agreed to this.

39:27.080 --> 39:28.920
- What do you say?
- I say…

39:29.000 --> 39:30.720
You…

39:35.920 --> 39:38.640
Yuanming, you are still ill.

39:38.720 --> 39:40.200
You need someone to take care of you.

39:40.280 --> 39:41.720
I will leave these two people here

39:41.800 --> 39:43.000
to prepare medicine, serve tea,

39:43.080 --> 39:44.560
and make the bed for you.

39:44.640 --> 39:46.400
You can't always trouble the Li family.

39:46.480 --> 39:47.920
After all, they are all women.

39:48.000 --> 39:49.320
Chai,

39:50.000 --> 39:51.080
you may not know

39:51.160 --> 39:53.480
Andao, the guy who lives next door,
how stubborn he can be.

39:53.560 --> 39:55.360
If a woman were to serve him closely,

39:55.440 --> 39:57.880
I'm afraid he'd want to throw
himself into a lake when he wakes.

39:58.640 --> 39:59.800
As for me, when studying,

39:59.880 --> 40:01.640
I fear nothing more
than the clamor of people.

40:01.720 --> 40:05.440
I can't simply ask them to not say a word.
So, there is no need to let them stay.

40:05.520 --> 40:07.320
I knew you would be unaccustomed.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.960
- Lingyao.
- Yes.

40:09.040 --> 40:10.000
Starting from today,

40:10.080 --> 40:11.720
you will stay here to serve Yuanming.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.680
Understood.

40:13.760 --> 40:14.960
Well…

40:15.040 --> 40:17.200
You shouldn't reject a mere page boy.

40:17.280 --> 40:19.640
If you say another word of refusal,
I will truly become angry.

40:21.880 --> 40:22.920
Alright.

40:23.000 --> 40:24.560
I'll accept him.

40:27.120 --> 40:28.240
I heard that Master Sang

40:28.320 --> 40:30.280
still hasn't recovered
after taking medicine.

40:30.360 --> 40:32.680
Perhaps the physician here
isn't very effective.

40:32.760 --> 40:34.840
To avoid any mishaps,
I have specially invited

40:34.920 --> 40:36.200
Physician Liu of Yutang Alley

40:36.280 --> 40:37.720
whose expertise is treating colds.

40:37.800 --> 40:39.680
He's guaranteed to cure
as soon as he treats.

40:44.000 --> 40:46.200
Be careful.

40:46.280 --> 40:48.600
Be careful. Slowly. I've got you.

40:51.480 --> 40:53.840
Not only did they raise the wall,

40:53.920 --> 40:55.960
they also assigned a servant
to watch the gate.

40:56.040 --> 40:57.480
They treat us as if we were thieves.

40:57.560 --> 41:00.240
The guest takes over to be the owner.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.640
The visitor turns into the host.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.920
What do they want?

41:05.960 --> 41:07.600
Shouhua, what are you laughing at?

41:08.560 --> 41:10.040
Today, I finally understand

41:10.120 --> 41:11.400
what "evil always prevails

41:11.480 --> 41:12.360
over justice" means.

41:12.960 --> 41:14.080
Kangning,

41:14.160 --> 41:17.280
we've managed to keep them here.
But it's still hard to have our way.

41:18.120 --> 41:19.520
Then, let's wait and see

41:19.600 --> 41:22.440
who plays the evil in the end.

41:29.040 --> 41:30.080
Young master,

41:30.160 --> 41:31.640
the courtyard is all cleaned up.

41:31.720 --> 41:33.360
Do you have any further instructions?

41:44.320 --> 41:45.160
Too short.

41:46.680 --> 41:47.640
Short?

42:12.520 --> 42:14.960
Where is the flute sound coming from?

42:39.240 --> 42:41.480
A crow has nested here,

42:41.560 --> 42:43.200
clamoring day and night

42:43.280 --> 42:45.120
and startling the patients,
so they can't rest.

42:45.200 --> 42:46.520
How can they recuperate with this?

42:47.400 --> 42:48.880
Do you even know how to handle things?

42:48.960 --> 42:51.680
Young master, I told them
to saw down this tree early on.

42:51.760 --> 42:54.600
But I was afraid the sound of cutting wood
would disturb the peace.

42:54.680 --> 42:56.480
The elders often say

42:56.560 --> 42:58.480
that when crows nest somewhere,

42:58.560 --> 43:00.160
there must be misfortune.

43:00.240 --> 43:02.120
I don't care about these superstitions.

43:02.200 --> 43:04.120
But they are facing
important examinations.

43:04.200 --> 43:05.600
So, it feels somewhat unlucky.

43:05.680 --> 43:08.240
Besides that, sawing a tree down
will only take half a day.

43:08.320 --> 43:10.640
If they can't endure the sawing,
it'll be crows another two months.

43:10.720 --> 43:12.880
You can't do the math?
You know it's because you're lazy.

43:12.960 --> 43:14.760
You're right. It's all my fault.

43:14.840 --> 43:18.200
Young master, you do have the resolve.
Without the crow's noise in the future,

43:18.280 --> 43:19.840
they can concentrate on their studies.

43:25.760 --> 43:26.760
No.

43:26.840 --> 43:29.160
He's waiting for me to argue with him.

43:29.240 --> 43:30.720
Don't fall for his trick.

43:32.720 --> 43:34.200
Kangning.

43:34.280 --> 43:35.280
Kangning.

43:37.160 --> 43:39.880
Put in a little more effort.
You get two more dishes at Pan Restaurant.

43:39.960 --> 43:41.240
Alright.

43:45.120 --> 43:46.600
The crow causes a ruckus every night,

43:46.680 --> 43:48.760
making Master Sang
toss and turn all last night.

43:48.840 --> 43:49.840
It's really annoying.

43:49.920 --> 43:52.080
Sawing the tree down is a good thing.

43:55.320 --> 43:56.280
Lingyao,

43:56.960 --> 43:58.200
your master

43:58.920 --> 44:00.120
is truly an interesting person.

44:01.760 --> 44:03.960
No. I must intervene. If I don't,

44:04.040 --> 44:05.680
they will tear down my courtyard.

44:05.760 --> 44:07.040
Mother,

44:07.120 --> 44:09.440
didn't you previously dislike that crow

44:09.520 --> 44:10.480
because it was noisy?

44:10.560 --> 44:12.960
You also complained the tree
sheds leaves all over the ground,

44:13.040 --> 44:14.080
which can't be swept away.

44:14.160 --> 44:15.520
You said someone would saw it down.

44:17.120 --> 44:20.120
Well, they were interrupting
Kangning's performance.

44:21.920 --> 44:24.760
Kangning, you don't look well.
I hope you're not upset.

44:25.400 --> 44:28.400
Fuhui, stop teasing me.
Can't you see Mother is also annoyed?

44:28.480 --> 44:30.160
It's so annoying

44:30.240 --> 44:31.640
that I'm going crazy.

44:32.600 --> 44:33.720
Mother, if you're so anxious,

44:33.800 --> 44:36.280
it's better to hire a good matchmaker
to talk with them directly.

44:36.360 --> 44:38.960
You silly girl, you don't know anything.

44:39.040 --> 44:40.600
Go away.

44:42.640 --> 44:44.120
You think Mother doesn't want to?

44:44.200 --> 44:45.200
These past few days,

44:45.280 --> 44:46.440
I have inquired clearly.

44:46.520 --> 44:48.760
That Du Yangxi is very aloof.

44:48.840 --> 44:51.440
He publicly refused
the Liu family's marriage proposal.

44:51.520 --> 44:52.560
Do you know the Liu family?

44:52.640 --> 44:54.520
They are wealthy and powerful.

44:54.600 --> 44:58.080
On the main street outside Chongming Gate,
more than half of the shops are theirs.

44:58.720 --> 44:59.840
Now that the news has spread,

44:59.920 --> 45:01.280
everyone praises him

45:01.360 --> 45:04.920
for his modesty and high integrity
and thinks he's a true gentleman.

45:05.600 --> 45:07.280
He rejected a wealthy and noble family.

45:07.360 --> 45:09.880
How could he possibly fancy
the daughter of a humble tea house?

45:10.640 --> 45:13.040
As for that Sang…

45:13.120 --> 45:14.760
- Sang Yanrang.
- Right.

45:14.840 --> 45:16.960
When he was at Xingguo Temple,

45:17.040 --> 45:19.440
he either read in his room
or sold calligraphy at their stall.

45:19.520 --> 45:21.160
He never mingled

45:21.240 --> 45:22.400
with other scholars.

45:22.480 --> 45:24.080
Because of his reticence,

45:24.160 --> 45:26.120
people gave him
the nickname "Sang the Stone".

45:26.200 --> 45:27.240
He's also a strange one.

45:28.280 --> 45:29.400
So what?

45:29.480 --> 45:32.040
On the day of heavy snow,
if my family hadn't kindly taken him in

45:32.120 --> 45:34.960
and offered food and medicine,
he'd be dead of hunger or cold somewhere.

45:35.920 --> 45:37.480
If he dares not to repay the kindness,

45:37.560 --> 45:39.800
Mother will make him notorious
in Bianjing.

45:39.880 --> 45:43.160
A marriage obtained by imposing gratitude
will only lead to endless dislike

45:43.240 --> 45:44.280
and hostility.

45:44.360 --> 45:46.160
Mother, we know
you want to marry off Kangning.

45:46.240 --> 45:48.520
But you can't push her into a pit of fire.

45:48.600 --> 45:49.960
Haode is right.

45:50.040 --> 45:53.960
Unless this marriage
is something he pursues by all means.

45:54.760 --> 45:56.080
That will be even more difficult.

45:56.160 --> 45:59.920
We can't have a girl
waiting in the boudoir

46:00.000 --> 46:01.280
to propose first, right?

46:01.360 --> 46:03.120
What's that over there?

46:05.000 --> 46:07.720
Mother worries that none of them
will pass the exams.

46:07.800 --> 46:11.680
She had me move all of their old books and
writings here to find out more about them.

46:13.480 --> 46:14.600
Got it.

46:14.680 --> 46:16.720
They said one can't do business
with a chasing heart.

46:16.800 --> 46:19.440
If we want them to come asking willingly,

46:19.520 --> 46:21.440
we have to set up slowly.

46:31.000 --> 46:33.360
Ask them to give the books back to me.

46:34.920 --> 46:36.160
Andao,

46:36.840 --> 46:38.520
no one has kidnapped your books.

46:38.600 --> 46:40.600
It's the physician who said
you've just come around.

46:40.680 --> 46:42.560
- You shouldn't be too tired.
- I'll say it again.

46:42.640 --> 46:45.120
I want my books.
Tell them to return them to me.

46:45.200 --> 46:48.440
If I can't smell the fragrance of books,
I am truly going to die.

46:49.080 --> 46:51.080
My books. I want my books.

49:18.920 --> 49:21.960
Subtitle translation by: Yun Zhao
